What:		/sys/devices/platform/soc/soc:qcom,dsi-display-primary/thermal_hbm_disabled
Date:		October 2026
Description:
		Read or write the Xiaomi primary display HBM thermal inhibit.
		0 permits requested HBM; 1 inhibits it. Other values are rejected.
		Inhibiting HBM preserves the requested state for restoration when
		the limit clears. Fingerprint HBM arbitration remains unchanged.
		The thermal daemon owns writes; this is not a user HBM toggle.
